OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife park remains closed after
OL,4,Atiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Wildlife Park remains closed
OL,7,Fafter a man climbed into a tiger
OL,8,Fenclosure and was fatally attacked.
OL,10,FPolice and the ambulance service were
OL,11,Fcalled to the park near Doncaster,
OL,12,FSouth Yorkshire, at about 13:30 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday after reports of a man
OL,14,Fclimbing down into the enclosure from a
OL,15,Fwalkway.
OL,17,FAn eyewitness described seeing the man
OL,18,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,19,Fnear the enclosure before he went in
OL,20,Fand was attacked. Police said the man
OL,21,Fsadly died at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
